 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The hand of the LORD came down on me and set me in a valley wide",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 16,
   "error_s": 1.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And it was full of bones, very many, very dry",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He led me all around them and he asked me can they rise",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Son of man, can these bones live",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "O Lord GOD, you know",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Dry bones, hear the word of the LORD",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am going to put breath in you, and you will live",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Dry bones, hear the word of the LORD",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And you will know that I am the LORD",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So I prophesied as I was commanded",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And there was a sound, a rattling",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And the bones came together, bone to bone",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sinews on them, flesh had grown, and skin had covered them over",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But there was no breath in them",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Dry bones, hear the word of the LORD",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am going to put breath in you, and you will live",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Dry bones, hear the word of the LORD",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And you will know that I am the LORD",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Come from the four winds, O breath",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And breathe into these slain, that they may live",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The breath came into them",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They came to life and stood on their feet",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Our bones are dried up, our hope is gone",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I am going to open your graves",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
